{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29158","headline":"长庆寺遇常州阮秀才 · 许浑","name":"长庆寺遇常州阮秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高阁晴轩对一峰，毗陵书客此相逢。\n晚收红叶题诗遍，秋待黄花酿酒浓。\n山馆日斜喧鸟雀，石潭波动戏鱼龙。\n上方有路应知处，疎磬寒蝉树几重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}